  "id": "COMPOUND:25505 - PROTEIN:6346",
  "verbalization": "Pauciflorine A is implicated in a complex network of interactions that may lead to a relationship with the DNMT3A2/3L complex. The evidence suggests that pauciflorine A acts as a target for multiple entities, with some of these targets directly interacting with the DNMT3A2/3L complex. Specifically, Leucophleol, a compound that is a target of pauciflorine A, has a direct interaction with the DNMT3A2/3L complex. Similarly, another target of pauciflorine A, peptide deformylase, also interacts with the DNMT3A2/3L complex. This indicates that pauciflorine A may influence the activity of the DNMT3A2/3L complex through its interaction with these downstream targets. The scores from the datasets suggest a moderate level of confidence in this relationship, but further experimental validation would be necessary to confirm the direct involvement of pauciflorine A in the regulation of the DNMT3A2/3L complex.",
